     "date": "2025-01-22T07:09:54Z"
    },
    "message": "Add new positions for Find dialog in editor\n\n* Update `OverlayWidgetPositionPreference` enum in `editorBrowser.ts` to include `BOTTOM_CENTER`, `LEFT_CENTER`, and `RIGHT_CENTER`\n* Modify `FindWidget` class in `findWidget.ts` to support positioning the Find dialog at the bottom, left, or right based on the new configuration option\n* Adjust `_reveal` and `_hide` methods in `findWidget.ts` to handle the new positions\n* Add CSS styles in `findWidget.css` to handle the new bottom, left, and right positions of the Find dialog",
